# Every discoverable area of Desolace, Shen'dralas, Feralas, Dustwallow Marsh
# (42 map overlays), for both factions. Each `explore` point is the centre of
# the area's map overlay hit rect in the Forever client's tables
# (WorldMapOverlay, UiMapXMapArt, UiMap, AreaTable via wago.tools, build
# 1.60.1.70338), in the map's live frame (written `live` where Forever moved the
# map or added it, else the Era frame it equals); area levels are
# AreaTable.ExplorationLevel; flight masters come from data/forever/travel.json.
# Zone order and travel lines are tools/lib/exploration/spec.js; inside a zone
# the areas are a shortest tour from where you arrive towards the next zone.

step Desolace (1/2)
  zone Desolace
  tip Picks up west of the Barrens, in Desolace, and ends in Dustwallow Marsh. 15 areas to discover here, levels 30-39.
  note "Exploring the entire world map on one character is a Forever Legacy Challenge (1 account-wide Legacy Point)."
  note "Fly to Stonetalon Peak (or to Nijel's Point if you have it) and take the road south-west out of the Stonetalon Mountains into Desolace; Nijel's Point in the north is the Alliance town." only Alliance
  note "Fly to Sun Rock Retreat and take the road south-west into Desolace; Shadowprey Village on the west coast is the Horde town." only Horde
  note "Flight path here: Nijel's Point (Baritanas Skyriver)." only Alliance
  note "Flight path here: Shadowprey Village (Thalon)." only Horde
  explore 54.4,12.4 "Tethris Aran"
